{"unit_id":"Oxygen640__dsh-plugin-nuaa-search#card-zh","repo":"Oxygen640/dsh-plugin-nuaa-search","commit":"abe2aae0255524cc98b75635de9160bf2c12da13","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-nuaa-search 是面向 DSH 的免 key 网页搜索插件，通过 Cordis 插件向 ctx.web 注册 local-search 提供方，并将 web_search 接口切换到该提供方。它可按 Bing 中文站、360 搜索和可配置 SearXNG 的顺序查找网页，也支持百度后端；支持自动降级、查询意图词变体、结果去重、数量上限、请求取消和超时返回。适合无法使用官方搜索密钥、希望让 DSH 直接获取网页标题、链接和摘要的用户。插件无需 API key；使用内置 fetch 访问搜索服务，可通过配置选择后端。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:650-675","cordis.patch.yml:14-37"]}
{"unit_id":"Oxygen640__dsh-plugin-nuaa-search#card-en","repo":"Oxygen640/dsh-plugin-nuaa-search","commit":"abe2aae0255524cc98b75635de9160bf2c12da13","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-nuaa-search adds keyless DSH web search through ctx.web. It queries Bing China or 360 Search, with Baidu and configured SearXNG available. Features include fallback, query variants, result limits, deduplication, cancellation, and deadlines. It uses built-in fetch.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:650-675","cordis.patch.yml:14-37"]}
